{"id":"19a74f37055b4fb9aad8269153ba82b0","owner":"Boston_Region_MPO","ownerId":"ebe0ed60b3d14431b112fe38dcdecb8a","created":1754407071000,"modified":1791564823000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"VZDashboard_Experience Builder","type":"Web Experience","typeKeywords":["EXB Experience","JavaScript","lastEditor:sstrumwasser_CTPS","modified: 1791489204749","publishVersion:1.21.0","Ready To Use","status: Published","template:blankfullscreen","version:1.21.0","Web Application","Web Experience","Web Mapping Application","Web Page","Web Site"],"description":"<p><span style='color:#000000;'>This dashboard, <\/span><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(20,20,20); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>created by the Boston Region Metropolitan Planning Organization (MPO)<\/span><\/span><span style='color:#000000;'>, was designed to help the region\u2019s 97 municipalities identify high-injury and high-risk locations, track safety performance over time, and gather community feedback on roadway safety concerns. Additionally, the dashboard provides resources for proven safety countermeasures and best practices to help transportation agencies select and implement effective safety improvements tailored to local needs. <\/span><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(20,20,20); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>Analysis of the data presented in the dashboard is included in the <\/span><\/span><a target='_blank' href='https://www.ctps.org/visionzero' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Boston Vision Zero Action Plan<\/a><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(20,20,20); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style='color:#000000;'>The Vision Zero Dashboard has four main pages:<\/span><\/p><ul><li><span style='color:#000000;'>Understand Crash Patterns<\/span><\/li><li><span style='color:#000000;'>Identify Dangerous Locations<\/span><\/li><li><span style='color:#000000;'>Improve Road Safety<\/span><\/li><li><span style='color:#000000;'>Hear from the Community<\/span><\/li><\/ul>","tags":[],"snippet":"This dashboard, created by the Boston Region Metropolitan Planning Organization (MPO), was designed to assist the 97 municipalities in the region with identification of location specific high injury and high risk corridors and intersections. Analysis of the data presented in the dashboard is included in the Boston Vision Zero Action Plan. ","thumbnail":null,"documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19a74f37055b4fb9aad8269153ba82b0","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":6718001,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":